[{"answer":"We are putting on a play at school.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Some of the students are actors in the play.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people are building the sets.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people will sew costumes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/4.mp3"},{"answer":"and some people will be makeup artists.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/5.mp3"},{"answer":"The teacher is the director of the play.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/6.mp3"},{"answer":"The play will be held on a big stage in the gymnasium.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/7.mp3"},{"answer":"The curtains will open, the lights will go on, and the play will begin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/8.mp3"},{"answer":"It will be very exciting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/9.mp3"},{"answer":"All of our families will come to see the play.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/10.mp3"},{"answer":"They will clap when the play is over.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/11.mp3"},{"answer":"My friend is very good at cutting wood and building things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/12.mp3"},{"answer":"He's helping to build the set.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/13.mp3"},{"answer":"My other friend, Michael, is an artist,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/14.mp3"},{"answer":"so he is painting the set so that it looks like a forest.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/15.mp3"},{"answer":"My friend Marie likes to put makeup on people, so she is a makeup artist.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/16.mp3"},{"answer":"She will put makeup on me so that I will look like an old woman.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Some of the mothers helped to sew the costumes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/18.mp3"},{"answer":"The play is called \"Hansel and Gretel\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I will play the part of the witch.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/20.mp3"},{"answer":"The boy who plays Hansel has to wear shorts and a shirt.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I wear a witch's hat and a black dress.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I also carry a broom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Some of the people in my class will be dressed like trees and flowers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/24.mp3"},{"answer":"This is a musical play,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/25.mp3"},{"answer":"and the trees and flowers will sing to Hansel and Gretel as they walk through the forest.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I can hardly wait for opening night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/27.mp3"},{"answer":"I want my family and friends to see me acting on stage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I hope they will like the play.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/29.mp3"},{"answer":"We have all learned our lines and worked very hard at making this play a success.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/78-the-school-play-2019-03-29-12-54-41/30.mp3"}]
